{"parentUuid":"db486a64-2805-4707-af5e-efc4d5ef626e","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"d2d8c1c5-cf59-474f-8fab-14abba897913","agentId":"a11eb425ca2c37694","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016xH4J3qCW1JMUpAT38cwpL","type":"tool_result","content":"# Huub Solver Repository Analysis\n\n**(1) Primary Language & Structure:**\nRust dominates at 98.1% of the codebase. The repository uses a workspace structure with multiple crates in the `crates/` directory, plus build tooling via `xtask/`.\n\n**(2) License:**\nMozilla Public License 2.0 (MPL-2.0)\n\n**(3) Most Recent Commit & Count:**\nThe page shows 382 total commits on the develop branch, but specific commit date information is not displayed in the provided content.\n\n**(4) Issue & PR Status:**\n4 open issues and 6 open pull requests are listed. Closed issue counts are not shown in this excerpt.\n\n**(5) Installation/Build Instructions:**\nThe provided content does not include README details about installation, building, or calling the solver—only the repo structure and metadata are visible.\n\n**(6) Supported Input Formats:**\nThe repository includes MiniZinc support (indicated by the `share/minizinc/huub/` directory and minizinc topic tag), but specific format documentation is absent from the displayed content.\n\n**(7) Language Bindings:**\nOnly Rust API is evident from the repository structure. Python bindings are not mentioned.\n\n**(8) Usage Examples:**\nNo examples are provided in the visible content.\n\n**(9) Global Constraints:**\nSupported global constraints are not listed in the provided excerpt.\n\n**(10) Maintainer Activity:**\nThree authors are cited (Dekker, Stuckey, Zhong). Recent activity metrics are unavailable from this page view."}]},"uuid":"e41275e8-e5bc-4fcd-890f-69cc30454983","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:50:04.690Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"db486a64-2805-4707-af5e-efc4d5ef626e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f