{"parentUuid":"7456223a-81a7-43af-959f-aa800a315f63","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"d2d8c1c5-cf59-474f-8fab-14abba897913","agentId":"a11eb425ca2c37694","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01X4q4m4viu3sYzW6DeTNdJr","type":"tool_result","content":"constraints.md                              11375\r\ndecision-variables.md                        7067\r\ngetting-started.md                           5875\r\nsearch-branching.md                         18285","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"fe8bc813-fc7e-4a3c-9a03-0fb34b1da6ae","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:52:04.195Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"7456223a-81a7-43af-959f-aa800a315f63","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"60e6db0d-fb04-4fe1-a010-ba5930f19346","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"d2d8c1c5-cf59-474f-8fab-14abba897913","agentId":"a11eb425ca2c37694","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RjkqoZkRwWp1X4AiMQNXqC","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"amazon-science cadical lc-out lc-in clause export learned clause persistence\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"GitHub - amazon-science/cadical: CaDiCaL SAT Solver\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/amazon-science/cadical\"},{\"title\":\"CaDiCaL simplified satisfiability solver - Amazon Science\",\"url\":\"https://www.amazon.science/code-and-datasets/cadical-simplified-satisfiability-solver\"},{\"title\":\"CADICAL, KISSAT, PARACOOBA, PLINGELING and TREENGELING\",\"url\":\"https://kfazekas.github.io/papers/BiereFazekasFleuryHeisinger-SAT-Competition-2020-solvers.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Too much information: Why CDCL solvers need to forget learned clauses - PMC\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC9417043/\"},{\"title\":\"From Clauses to Klauses* - CMU School of Computer Science\",\"url\":\"https://www.cs.cmu.edu/~mheule/publications/knf.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Too much information: Why CDCL solvers need to forget learned clauses | PLOS One\",\"url\":\"https://journals.plos.org/plosone/article?id=10.1371/journal.pone.0272967\"},{\"title\":\"Proofs for Incremental SAT with Inprocessing Benjamin Kiesl-Reiter\",\"url\":\"https://assets.amazon.science/0f/27/487a4cb24557b9a5d8d4613af264/proofs-for-incremental-sat-with-inprocessing.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Conflict-driven clause learning (CDCL) SAT solvers — CS-E3220: Propositional satisfiability and SAT solvers documentation\",\"url\":\"https://users.aalto.fi/~tjunttil/2020-DP-AUT/notes-sat/cdcl.html\"},{\"title\":\"Conflict-driven clause learning - Wikipedia\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Conflict-driven_clause_learning\"},{\"title\":\"Encoding Redundancy for Satisfaction-Driven Clause Learning | Springer Nature Link\",\"url\":\"https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-030-17462-0_3\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about the Amazon-Science CaDiCaL SAT solver and its learned clause persistence features:\n\n## Learned Clause Export and Import\n\nThe `--lc-out` flag writes learned clauses to a file at the end of the solver run, and the `--lc-in` flag reads learned clauses from a file at startup.\n\n## State Persistence Overview\n\nThe version of CaDiCaL presented by Amazon Science can store the most relevant parts of its state (irredundant clauses, redundant clauses, and the reconstruction stack) in files, and it can also read this state from files at startup. This allows you to stop CaDiCaL in the middle of a run (e.g., by specifying a timeout via the -t argument), store its state, and later resume the solver run by loading the previously stored state.\n\n## File Format Details\n\nEach line of a learned-clause file contains the literals of a clause, then a 0, followed by a non-negative integer for the LBD, and finally another 0. For irredundant clauses and learned clauses, the corresponding files contain enough information to distinguish between binary/plain-text, so no explicit flag is needed when reading them.\n\nThis functionality is based on research described in the paper \"Migrating Solver State\" (Armin Biere, Md Solimul Chowdhury, Marijn J.H. Heule, Benjamin Kiesl, and Michael W. Whalen; SAT 2022).\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"c346e55f-5048-4e92-a8d7-7aaf613d55f6","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:52:11.459Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"60e6db0d-fb04-4fe1-a010-ba5930f19346","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"c346e55f-5048-4e92-a8d7-7aaf613d55f6","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a11eb425ca2c37694","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01YScNaLJuHax2GWPWK3ezSs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have everything I need. Time to compose the final report.\n\n---\n\n# Huub solver 深度调研报告\n\n## 1. 论文细节 (LIPIcs.CP.2025.42)\n\n短论文 12 页，作者 Jip J. Dekker, Alexey Ignatiev, Peter J. Stuckey, Allen Z. Zhong (Monash 大学 OPTIMA 中心)。**核心架构**：放弃 LCG 自定义 SAT 后端的传统做法，把 CP 引擎反过来做成\"外部传播器\"挂在 IPASIR-UP 之下，让 SAT 求解器 (CaDiCaL 2.1.3) 主导搜索流程。控制流是：SAT 决策 → `notify_assignments` → CP 优先级队列跑 propagator → 通过 `propagate` / `add_external_clause` 推断 → 冲突时 `add_reason_clause` 给出反向解释 → `notify_backtrack` 回滚 CP trail。`decide` 回调允许 CP 端覆盖分支策略，否则退化为 VSIDS。\n\n**关键工程难点**：IPASIR-UP 强制要求解释 clause 里的 literal 必须已经被 SAT 引擎注册过。这意味着懒生成的 literal **不能**在反向解释时引入，从而**禁掉了 lifting 优化**（论文 §3 第 3 段，是个真实 pitfall）。\n\nPDF: https://drops.dagstuhl.de/storage/00lipics/lipics-vol340-cp2025/LIPIcs.CP.2025.42/LIPIcs.CP.2025.42.pdf\n\n## 2. Benchmark 实测（MiniZinc Challenge 2024，20 题×5 实例，20 分钟超时，Xeon Gold 6338 单核 16GB）\n\n| 模式 | Solver | PAR2 | OPTIMAL | UNSAT | SAT | UNK |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| SAT-based | **Huub** | **157613** | **55** | **4** | 35 | 6 |\n| SAT-based | CP-SAT | 163832 | 54 | 3 | 41 | 2 |\n| SAT-based | Chuffed | 184495 | 50 | 2 | 31 | 17 |\n| Fixed | CP-SAT | **241410** | **31** | 3 | 53 | **13** |\n| Fixed | Huub | 250824 | 29 | 3 | 56 | 12 |\n| Fixed | Chuffed | 252075 | 28 | 3 | 56 | 13 |\n\n**SAT-based 模式 Huub 整体最强** (PAR2 最低、OPTIMAL 数最多)。**Fixed 搜索模式 CP-SAT 仍领先**。\n\n**Huub 输的题目**（论文 Table 5）：`accap` (4382 vs 7559)、`community-detection` (346 vs 10950)、`network_50_cstr` (182 vs 424)、`tiny-cvrp` (11024 vs 14406)、`yumi-dynamic` (10977 vs 18098)。**根本原因**：缺 `diffn`、`cumulative`、`global difference` 这些全局约束的高效 propagator。\n\n**Huub 赢的题目**：`cable-tree-wiring` (8103 vs 858)、`fox-geese-corn`、`harmony` (7265 vs 1048)、`word-equations` (3642 vs 274) — 这些主要靠 SAT 引擎的现代特性 (inprocessing、subsumption、变量消除) 而非全局 propagator。\n\n## 3. GitHub 仓库 (https://github.com/huub-solver/huub)\n\n- **语言**: Rust 98.1%，2024 edition\n- **License**: **MPL-2.0**（弱 copyleft，可静态链接到我们项目，但对 Huub 自身文件的修改要开源）\n- **活跃度**: 31 stars / 9 forks / 382 commits / 默认分支 `develop`，**最新 commit 是昨天**（5/7 refactor: ReasoningEngine 命名、5/6 大量重构 IntPropCond/IntEvent，文档站点 5/6 上线 PR #310），10 open issues / 27 closed issues\n- **结构**: workspace + 两个 crate (`crates/huub` 核心、`crates/huub-cli` CLI 入口)\n- **文档**: README 极简（只有口号 + 链接），实际文档在 `docs/` 下用 mdBook 写，发布到 https://huub.solutions ；mdBook 章节包括 introduction、modelling (constraints / decision-variables / getting-started / search-branching)、propagators (空)、case-studies (jobshop.md 8.6KB 完整 Rust 嵌入示例)\n- **API docs**: https://docs.rs/huub/latest/huub/\n\n**至关重要的一个发现**：论文说\"只支持 all_different 和 disjunctive\"。但 develop 分支 `crates/huub/src/constraints/` 里实际已经有：`bool_array_element`, **`cumulative` (37KB)**, `disjunctive` (50KB), `int_abs`, `int_array_element` (17KB), `int_array_minimum`, `int_div`, **`int_linear` (38KB)**, `int_mul`, **`int_no_overlap` (31KB)**, `int_pow`, `int_set_contains`, `int_table`, `int_unique`, `int_value_precede` (37KB)。**论文发表后他们补齐了 cumulative + 2D no_overlap (diffn 等价物) + 强 linear**——这是真实业内进展，不是宣传。\n\n## 4. API 形态\n\n- **CLI**: `huub-cli` crate，吃 FlatZinc 文件，是 MiniZinc challenge 的标准接入方式\n- **MiniZinc bundle**: `share/minizinc/huub/` 里有 redefinition 文件，装上后可在 MiniZinc IDE 选 Huub 作为 backend\n- **Rust embedded API**（重点）：核心暴露 `huub::Model` 类型 (`crates/huub/src/model.rs:Model`)，类似 CP-SAT 的 `CpModelBuilder`。从 jobshop 案例看，典型流程是：`Model::default()` → 创建 `IntDecision` 决策变量 → 调用 `model.disjunctive(...)`、`model.int_linear(...)` 等 post 约束 → 定义 objective → `model.to_solver()` 转成 `Solver` → 注册自定义 `Brancher` (`solver.push_brancher(...)`) → 调 branch-and-bound 跑解，每找到解触发 callback\n- **自定义 propagator/brancher**: 公开了 `Propagator<E: ReasoningEngine>` trait 和 `Brancher` trait，可以自己写约束。`pub mod actions / constraints / model / solver / views` 全部暴露\n- **IPASIR-UP user propagator**: **没有直接暴露给 Huub 的用户**。Huub 自己消费 IPASIR-UP（通过 `pindakaas` 0.2.3 这个 SAT 抽象层连到 CaDiCaL），用户写 propagator 走的是 Huub 自己的 trait\n- **Python bindings**: **完全没有**。crates.io、docs.rs、文档全无 PyO3/binding 痕迹\n\n## 5. 支持的约束类型 vs 我们 routing 子问题需求\n\n| 约束 | Huub develop 状态 | 我们的需求 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 线性整数 | `int_linear.rs` 38KB，强 propagator | 需要（流量守恒） |\n| Boolean clauses | 原生（直接进 SAT） | 需要 |\n| `all_different` | 有 (`int_unique.rs`) | 不强需 |\n| `cumulative` | 有 (38KB，新增) | 可能用于资源 |\n| `disjunctive` (1D) | 有 (50KB) | 不直接用 |\n| `int_no_overlap` (2D diffn) | 有 (32KB，新增) | **直接对应 placement 不重叠** |\n| `element` | 有 (`int_array_element` 17KB) | 用于查表 |\n| `table` | 有 (`int_table.rs`) | 候选 placement 枚举可用 |\n| **reachability / circuit** | **没有** | **routing 子问题刚需** |\n| **multi-commodity flow** | **没有** | **flow 子问题刚需** |\n| **subcircuit / path** | **没有** | routing 需要 |\n\n**致命缺口**：Huub 没有 `circuit` / `subcircuit` / 任何图可达性 propagator，flow 也没有原生支持。我们的 routing/flow 子问题需要自己写 propagator 或用线性约束硬编码——后者会失去 LCG 的优势。\n\n## 6. 集成路径 vs Round 1 amazon-science/cadical fork\n\n**amazon-science/cadical** 是纯 SAT solver，提供 `--lc-out`/`--lc-in` 把 learned clause + reconstruction stack 落盘读取（基于 SAT 2022 \"Migrating Solver State\" 论文，by Biere/Heule/Kiesl）。**它是 SAT 层 nogood 持久化机制**，不是 CP-level 接入。要用它，我们得把 routing 子问题先 CNF 化，然后人肉做 Benders cut → SAT clause 的转换。\n\n**Huub** 是完整 LCG 框架，CP 模型 + 整数变量 + 解释机制都有。集成方向有两条路线：\n\n**路线 A：通过 FlatZinc 喂模型** — 把 `routing_subproblem.py` 重写成 MiniZinc 模型，subprocess 调 `huub-cli` 跑。工程量小（几天），但 (1) 跨次复用 nogood 困难——FlatZinc 一次一个文件，learned clause 不持久化（Huub 现版未实现 lc-out）；(2) 跟我们 master CP-SAT 的协调要靠重启 solver；(3) routing-specific propagator 写不进去。**适合做 baseline 对比，不适合替换**。\n\n**路线 B：Rust 嵌入 + 自定义 propagator** — 把 routing/binding 子问题用 `huub::Model` API 在 Rust 里建，自己实现 reachability 的 `Propagator` trait。需要 Rust 工程能力 + Python ↔ Rust FFI（PyO3 自己写）+ 把 Benders 协议序列化跨进程。**工程量 4-8 周**，且 Huub 一边在剧烈重构（看到昨天还在改 ReasoningEngine 的命名和 IntPropCond 位置——0.1.0 版本，API 不稳定），跟我们项目对齐风险高。\n\n**对比 amazon-science cadical fork**：cadical fork 工程量 1-2 周（只要 CNF 化 routing 子问题 + 解析 lc-out 文件 + 做 nogood 注入），**learned clause 跨次复用是 cadical fork 原生支持**，Huub develop 现版不支持。但 cadical 路线我们要自己做 CP→SAT 编码（element/no_overlap 都得手编）。\n\n## 7. 性能预期\n\n论文没有 routing 类问题的直接对比。我们最关心的 placement/no_overlap 在 MiniZinc Challenge 里最接近的是 `tiny-cvrp` (我们要做 routing) 和 `cable-tree-wiring` (我们做布线) — Huub 在 `cable-tree-wiring` 上 PAR2 是 858 vs CP-SAT 8103，**~10× 优势**；但 `tiny-cvrp` 上 11024 vs 14406，CP-SAT 反而赢。**对我们 70×70 grid placement，没有公开数据可推断**，必须自己跑 baseline。\n\n## 8. 学习曲线 / pitfalls\n\n1. **API 还在动**：5/6-5/7 主分支大量改名 (`ReasoningEngine`, `IntPropCond`, `actions::integer`)，0.1.0 未稳定，跟主分支会很痛\n2. **Lifting 失效**：IPASIR-UP 接口禁懒生成 literal 进解释 → linear propagator 的解释 clause 比 Chuffed 弱\n3. **没 Python binding** — 我们整个项目是 Python，需要 FFI 或 subprocess 桥接\n4. **没 circuit / flow propagator** — routing 子问题最关键的约束没有原生支持\n5. **没 learned clause 跨次持久化** —— 不像 cadical fork 的 lc-out/lc-in\n6. **MPL-2.0** 弱 copyleft 对我们项目本身没影响（不修改 Huub 文件就行），但要静态链接需注意分发\n\n## 9. 对我们项目的具体集成方案 + 工程量\n\n**短期 (Phase 3B 加速)：不集成 Huub，走 amazon-science cadical fork 路线 D'**\n\n理由：\n- 我们 routing 子问题已经在 OR-Tools CP-SAT 里跑通，再换 LCG 框架是大重写\n- Huub 0.1.0 API 在剧烈变动，盯主分支会被打乱\n- Round 1 cadical fork 提供的 learned clause 跨次复用 (lc-out/lc-in) 正是我们要的，Huub 现版没有\n- Huub 缺 circuit/flow propagator，对 routing 帮助有限\n\n**中期 (Phase 4 探索)：用 Huub 做 placement 主问题的 baseline 对比**\n\n- 工程量：3-5 天\n- 把 valley4 70×70 placement 写成 MiniZinc 模型（用 `int_no_overlap` + `int_table` 编码 candidate placement）\n- subprocess 调 `huub-cli`，跟我们 CP-SAT master 在同样 candidate set 上比 PAR2\n- 只读 baseline，不进 certified path（符合 AI Safety Contract 类似要求）\n- 输出归档到 `data/exports/baselines/huub_minizinc/`\n\n**长期：不建议做 Rust 嵌入式集成**\n\n除非 Huub 1.0 API 稳定 + 加上 circuit/flow propagator + 加 lc-out 等价物，否则 Rust 路线 4-8 周工作量换不回足够收益。CP-SAT 的并行 portfolio + simplex LP 集成在我们这种 placement-heavy 问题上仍然有结构性优势。\n\n## 关键链接清单\n\n- 论文 PDF: https://drops.dagstuhl.de/storage/00lipics/lipics-vol340-cp2025/LIPIcs.CP.2025.42/LIPIcs.CP.2025.42.pdf\n- DOI: https://doi.org/10.4230/LIPIcs.CP.2025.42\n- GitHub: https://github.com/huub-solver/huub\n- 文档站: https://huub.solutions\n- crates.io: https://crates.io/crates/huub\n- API docs: https://docs.rs/huub/latest/huub/\n- Zenodo artifact: https://zenodo.org/records/15591853\n- jobshop 嵌入示例: https://github.com/huub-solver/huub/blob/develop/docs/src/case-studies/jobshop.md\n- amazon-science/cadical (对比): https://github.com/amazon-science/cadical\n- IPASIR-UP 论文: https://doi.org/10.4230/LIPICS.SAT.2023.8"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4922,"cache_read_input_tokens":78837,"output_tokens":5388,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4922},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":5388,"cache_read_input_tokens":78837,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4922,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4922,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CaosU2nRdAAZFFudUKpeX","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"abae19c3-d040-4e0c-862e-269b85ecd4a9","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:53:48.211Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
